`,e.jsxs(t.p,{children:["The inspected integration uses ",e.jsx(t.a,{href:"https://github.com/YarnSpinnerTool/YarnSpinner-Godot-GDScript/blob/642e9ad61ff8e7dd01476fd5a89e675d380c3122/LICENSE.md",children:"Yarn Spinner Public Licence 1.0"}),", not a blanket MIT license. Section 3.3 restricts use of covered software/documentation/materials for training, fine-tuning or otherwise improving AI, while expressly permitting AI-assisted game development, Yarn-script writing and learning. Section 3.2 permits certain integrating tools subject to users independently obtaining Yarn and the tool not bundling, redistributing or automatically downloading it. Attribution and distribution conditions also apply. Treat optimizer datasets, automated improvement and redistribution as purpose-specific unresolved eligibility; this read-only report does not determine their legality or grant permission. Do not apply this license summary to every historical Yarn version, engine integration or component. Prefer a separately cleared alternative for an executable optimization experiment until the intended use is reviewed."]}),`
